  <h2>Limits</h2>
  <p>Rides cover most places reachable by car, but not remote spots such as isolated keys or the deep swamp. <strong>After a crime, you can't take a taxi in that area</strong> (checked on our stream), so plan to drive away from a robbery yourself. It's one more reason to <a href="/gta-6/make-money/">bank safe cash at an ATM</a> rather than haul jewelry to a fence. Early on, <a href="/gta-6/make-money/">your cash</a> matters since the taxi uses pocket money. The <a href="/gta-6/map/">map</a> shows where you can go.</p>

  <h2>Not confirmed</h2>
  <p>One outlet also describes bus and train routes with a paid skip option, but we've only found it in a single guide, so we're not treating it as settled.</p>
